<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-grow px-4 py-20 text-center">
  <p class="font-marcellus text-8xl text-stone-900 mb-4">404</p>
  <h1 class="font-marcellus text-3xl text-stone-900 mb-4">Page Not Found</h1>
  <p class="text-stone-600 max-w-md mb-2">Sorry, we can't seem to locate that page.</p>
  <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm max-w-md mb-8">Try double-checking the URL for errors, then hit the refresh button on your browser.</p>
